Subject: [PATCH] media: imx363: default digital gain to sensor unity

The sensor's Q8 digital gain uses 0x100 for unity. The former default
0x400 applies 4x digital gain to all Bayer channels. Verified against the
original Xiaomi QTech/Sunny driver and fixed-exposure captures on this phone.
Keep the control ABI unchanged; correct only its default.

--- a/drivers/media/i2c/imx363.c
+++ b/drivers/media/i2c/imx363.c
@@ -55,7 +55,7 @@
 #define IMX363_REG_GB_DIGITAL_GAIN	CCI_REG16(0x0214)
 #define IMX363_DGTL_GAIN_MIN		0
 #define IMX363_DGTL_GAIN_MAX		4096	/* Max = 0xFFF */
-#define IMX363_DGTL_GAIN_DEFAULT	1024
+#define IMX363_DGTL_GAIN_DEFAULT	256	/* Q8 unity gain */
 #define IMX363_DGTL_GAIN_STEP		1
 
 /* HDR control */
